# Line endings are part of this repository's contract: every hand-written file ends with exactly one
# LF, and the shipped `lib/` must stay byte-identical to what `npm run build` produces on any machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.png binary
# A patch must survive byte-exact or `git apply` rejects it, and its context lines legitimately carry
# trailing whitespace (`+ ` marks a blank source line), so neither normalization nor the whitespace
# check applies.
*.patch -text -whitespace
